OL,4,CDemocrats nominate Hakeem Jeffries to  
OL,5,Cbe US Speaker of the House             
OL,6,GDemocrats in the US House of           
OL,7,GRepresentatives officially nominated   
OL,8,GHakeem Jeffries to be Speaker, setting 
OL,9,Ghim on the path to become the first    
OL,10,Gblack lawmaker to lead the chamber.    
OL,12,FThe House will elect its new Speaker   
OL,13,Fon 3 January, when the next term       
OL,14,Fbegins and Democrats will be in the    
OL,15,Fmajority.                              
